<title>NORWAY: Norway's Feb foreign trade surplus NOK 8.86 bln.</title>
<headline>Norway's Feb foreign trade surplus NOK 8.86 bln.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statstics Norway (SSB) issued the following economic indicator. Figures (billions of crowns, excludes shipping and oil platforms)</p>
<p> NORWAY'S FOREIGN TRADE	FEB 1997    JAN 1997    FEB 1996</p>
<p> Imports			    17.15	 18.21	 17.35</p>
<p> Exports			    26.01	 29.94	 24.54</p>
<p> Balance			     8.86	 11.73	  7.19</p>
<p> Excluding oil/gas		-4.33	 -3.71	 -4.21</p>
<p>NOTE -- SSB has revised figures for January 1997 and February 1996.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
